Module LAPT_1RB0LC_0LC1RD_0RD1LA_1LC1RB.
(** * LAPT_1RB0LC_0LC1RD_0RD1LA_1LC1RB: TRANSITION-LEVEL board for machine 1RB0LC_0LC1RD_0RD1LA_1LC1RB, boarded by CERTIFICATE.

    Auto-emitted by tools/counters/emit_lapcert.py (UNTRUSTED emitter; the Coq
    kernel re-runs the checker on every line below).  Left-growth binary
