    apply (fire_via_ovf_lift tm Cc Hi (StB, S1)).
    intros p1 j1 E1. apply (fire_lift_of_csteps tm Cc).
    apply (fireo_1RB0LC_1LA1RD_0RD0LC_1RA___ [SCycL 3 0; SWin 2] (StB, S1) ltac:(vm_compute; reflexivity)
